                    scenarioA_text:         `Three months in, the bakery delivers €3,000 of stock that sits unsold during a school exam break. The Hub owes €3,000 and has €400 in the bank. A final-demand letter arrives. Who pays the missing €2,600?`,
                    scenarioB_title:        `Scenario B — The Friendship Break`,
                    scenarioB_text:         `After one year, Aisha takes the part-time tutoring job and wants out. She wants her €800 back. Maya and Daniel want to continue. Which form makes this clean?`,
